2026-04-30 18:07:10,823 - [36mDEBUG[0m agent_orchestrator - {"message": "New iteration for state loop: s2c_verify_yob", "call_id": "call_simulation_5fd074c", "transcript_with_tool_calls": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi. Thanks for calling American Express. I'm your AI assistant here to help you. This call may be recorded, monitored, and analyzed for compliance and to improve our systems. I'm having trouble pulling up your information using the number that you're calling from. May I please have the phone number that you have on file with us?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Sure, it's 706-622-6252."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thank you.\nLet me look that up for you. <break time=\"500ms\" />\n"}, {"role": "assistant", "created_at": 1777552551521, "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "toolu_vrtx_01Rbcyxbmq2U1nJSgN6D5NC3", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "get_details_from_contact", "arguments": "{\"phone\": \"7066226252\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "toolu_vrtx_01Rbcyxbmq2U1nJSgN6D5NC3", "content": "{\"message\": \"No consumers found for the given search criteria\"}", "created_at": 1777552552317}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I wasn't able to find any information with the phone number seven zero six <break time=\"0.25s\" /> six two two <break time=\"0.25s\" /> six two five two. Was that the correct number?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Yes, that's correct. Maybe try looking it up by my account number instead?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I appreciate that, but I'm unable to look you up using an account number. I can also try looking you up with your Social Security number. May I have your full Social Security number?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Okay, it's 6 3 9 9 9 2 0 4 4."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thank you.\nLet me look that up for you. <break time=\"500ms\" />\n"}, {"role": "assistant", "created_at": 1777552586169, "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "toolu_vrtx_01TdqMCFnra3dGSsyQBwfcFR", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "get_details_from_contact", "arguments": "{\"ssn\": \"639992044\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "toolu_vrtx_01TdqMCFnra3dGSsyQBwfcFR", "content": "{\"user_details\": {\"consumer_id\": \"70360219\", \"first_name\": \"KIT\", \"last_name\": \"LAM\", \"emails\": [\"Ethan.Shannon@na.firstsource.com\"], \"ssn\": \"2044\", \"dob\": \"1994\", \"zipcode\": \"75040\", \"address\": \"5534 DORCHESTER LANE\", \"city\": \"GARLAND\", \"state\": \"TX\"}, \"account_details\": [{\"account_id\": \"70360219\", \"consumer_id\": \"70360219\", \"debt_amount\": \"10492.96\", \"status\": \"ACT\", \"additional_fields\": {\"apollo_eligible\": true, \"oasis_eligible\": true, \"non_digital\": false, \"ud_status\": false, \"oos_status\": false, \"is_po_box\": false, \"card_type\": \"GL\", \"apollo_limit\": \"2100.00\", \"oasis_limit\": \"3100.00\", \"card_open_date\": \"2022-07-07\", \"min_settlement_pct\": \"45\", \"max_post_charge_months\": \"36\", \"max_payment_start_date\": \"30\", \"card_type_name\": \"GOLD CARD\"}}]}", "created_at": 1777552587306}, {"role": "assistant", "created_at": 1777552590079, "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "toolu_vrtx_01KGwAQwbvD6n4nGV95pycUV", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "transition_to_s2a_verify_name", "arguments": "{\"lookup_method\": \"ssn\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "toolu_vrtx_01KGwAQwbvD6n4nGV95pycUV", "content": "Transitioned to \"s2a_verify_name\" state", "created_at": 1777552590079}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Could you please help me with your full name?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Take your time."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thank you for your patience. I need your full name to proceed with verification."}, {"role": "user", "content": "My name is Kit Lam."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "\nGive me one moment please. <break time=\"500ms\" />\n"}, {"role": "assistant", "created_at": 1777552609560, "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "toolu_vrtx_01AUS7LUjctCZ9ZRJaqrAiqP", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "verify_user_name_state", "arguments": "{\"name_candidate\": \"Kit Lam\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "toolu_vrtx_01AUS7LUjctCZ9ZRJaqrAiqP", "content": "Name verified successfully. The spoken name matches our records. Thank the user and proceed", "created_at": 1777552609560}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "\nThank you for providing that. <break time=\"500ms\" />\n"}, {"role": "assistant", "created_at": 1777552611550, "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "toolu_vrtx_01Bgsx2bimVHChaGgmNqQgv7", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "transition_to_s2c_verify_yob", "arguments": "{}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "toolu_vrtx_01Bgsx2bimVHChaGgmNqQgv7", "content": "Transitioned to \"s2c_verify_yob\" state", "created_at": 1777552611550}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "And could you please provide your four-digit year of birth?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "1994."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "\nPlease hold while I check this. <break time=\"500ms\" />\n"}, {"role": "assistant", "created_at": 1777552630128, "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "toolu_vrtx_01HhZ4zWNMcZtvmtcXELMh5W", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "execute_code", "arguments": "{\"code\": \"\\nconsumer_year = '1994'\\nstored_dob = '1994'\\nprint('match' if consumer_year == stored_dob.split('-')[0] else 'mismatch')\\n\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "toolu_vrtx_01HhZ4zWNMcZtvmtcXELMh5W", "content": "match\n", "created_at": 1777552630817}], "tools": ["<proagent.llm_tool.LLMTool object at 0x1162c6e50>", "<proagent.llm_tool.LLMTool object at 0x116297550>", "<proagent.llm_tool.LLMTool object at 0x116366510>", "<proagent.llm_tool.LLMTool object at 0x11629a590>"]} [90m{"call_id": "call_simulation_5fd074c", "room_name": null, "tenant_id": null} [90m/Users/vansh/Developer/agent-orchestrator/agent_orchestrator/proagent/state_loop.py:591[0m

2026-04-30 18:07:10,823 - [36mDEBUG[0m agent_orchestrator - {"call_id": "call_simulation_5fd074c", "event": "LLMClient: Tools being sent", "tools": [{"name": "end_the_call", "description": "When you need to end the call or user has asked to end the call", "parameters": [], "filler_text": null}, {"name": "transfer_call", "description": "Transfers the call to a live agent. CRITICAL: Always deliver an appropriate closing statement to the consumer before invoking this tool. The closing statement and this tool invocation must be in the same response. Two modes \u2014 follow your general prompt's transfer rules: (1) HARD TRANSFER: For special cases requiring immediate transfer (military, self-harm, FDCPA debt validation, media/press, recording refusal, DNC, cease and desist, attorney representation, debt settlement company, fraud, bankruptcy, deceased, harassment complaints, supervisor requests, vulnerability, OFAC, Spanish support, modifying existing arrangements, refund requests, third-party involvement after consumer is informed, identity verification failure) \u2014 deliver the closing statement and invoke this tool immediately without asking for consent. (2) SOFT TRANSFER: For all other scenarios (consumer insists on live agent, lookup failures, no records found, complex discrepancies, update requests, debt disputes, payment history disputes, charge disputes, membership fee disputes, prior settlement claims, credit reporting questions, legal proceedings questions) \u2014 first offer the transfer, wait for explicit verbal confirmation (e.g., 'yes', 'sure', 'okay', 'please do', 'go ahead'), deliver a closing statement, then invoke this tool. Exception for soft transfers: if the consumer is uncooperative or ambiguous after the offer, proceed without explicit confirmation.", "parameters": [{"name": "verification_status", "description": "The verification status of the user. Use 'yes' if the user has completed full identity verification and the debt collection disclosure has been stated. Use 'no' if the user failed verification or verification was not completed.", "type": "string", "required": true, "items": null}], "filler_text": null}, {"name": "execute_code", "description": "Execute sandboxed Python EXCLUSIVELY for comparing consumer-provided verification digits against stored values. In this state, use ONLY for comparing the consumer's converted year or phone number against the stored verification value. The agent must first convert the consumer's spoken input to a digit string, then call this tool for the comparison. Print ONLY 'match' or 'mismatch'. NO COMMENTS in the code.", "parameters": [{"name": "code", "description": "Python code for verification comparison. Print only 'match' or 'mismatch'.\nExample:\nconsumer_year = '1973'\nstored_dob = '1973-06-15'\nprint('match' if consumer_year == stored_dob.split('-')[0] else 'mismatch')", "type": "string", "required": true, "items": null}], "filler_text": "One moment while I check. "}, {"name": "transition_to_s3_debt_information", "description": "ONLY transition when ALL of the following are confirmed: (1) Consumer verbally provided a full four-digit year of birth that exactly matches the stored year. A two-digit year (e.g., '85' for 1985) does NOT satisfy this condition \u2014 the consumer must provide all four digits. (2) No Stage 3 transfer response was given for year of birth. If any condition is false, do NOT use this edge.", "parameters": [{"name": "verification_status", "description": "Use 'yes' ONLY if year of birth was confirmed through consumer verbal input in this state. Use 'no' if verification was not completed.", "type": "string", "required": true, "items": null}, {"name": "discussed_account_id", "description": "The account id of the user found in the account_id.", "type": "string", "required": true, "items": null}], "filler_text": null}]} [90m{"call_id": "call_simulation_5fd074c", "room_name": null, "tenant_id": null} [90m/Users/vansh/Developer/agent-orchestrator/