2026-04-30 18:10:38,476 - [36mDEBUG[0m agent_orchestrator - {"message": "Requesting code execution", "code": "\nfrom datetime import datetime\nfrom zoneinfo import ZoneInfo\n\ncard_number = '4111111111111111'\ncard_number_clean = ''.join(filter(str.isdigit, card_number))\ndigits = [int(d) for d in card_number_clean][::-1]\nchecksum = 0\nfor i, digit in enumerate(digits):\n    if i % 2 == 1:\n        doubled = digit * 2\n        checksum += doubled if doubled < 10 else doubled - 9\n    else:\n        checksum += digit\nluhn_valid = checksum % 10 == 0\n\ndigit_count = len(card_number_clean)\nvalid_length = digit_count in [16, 19]\nis_amex = card_number_clean.startswith(('34', '37'))\n\nexpiry_month = 12\nexpiry_year = 2030\nexpiry_date = datetime(expiry_year, expiry_month, 1, tzinfo=ZoneInfo(\"America/New_York\"))\nfrom calendar import monthrange\nlast_day = monthrange(expiry_year, expiry_month)[1]\nexpiry_last_day = datetime(expiry_year, expiry_month, last_day, tzinfo=ZoneInfo(\"America/New_York\"))\n\ntoday = datetime.now(ZoneInfo(\"America/New_York\"))\nfinal_payment_date = datetime(2026, 5, 30, tzinfo=ZoneInfo(\"America/New_York\"))\n\nvalid_for_final = expiry_last_day >= final_payment_date\nvalid_for_first = expiry_last_day >= today\n\nprint(f\"luhn_valid:{luhn_valid},digit_count:{digit_count},valid_length:{valid_length},is_amex:{is_amex},valid_for_final:{valid_for_final},valid_for_first:{valid_for_first}\")\n", "execution_url": "https://python-codeserver.service.dev.external.usea2.aws.prodigaltech.com/sessions/2561e5e951ae40bda4b4a982c2effad3/execute"} [90m{"call_id": null, "room_name": null, "tenant_id": null} [90m/Users/vansh/Developer/agent-orchestrator/agent_orchestrator/proagent/utils.py:613[0m

