xpression preferred\\n- NO COMMENTS: Do not include any comments in the code. Write self-explanatory variable names if needed, but never use # comments\\n- For money: use Decimal, quantize to 2 decimals with ROUND_DOWN\\n- Default timezone: US/Eastern", "parameters": [{"name": "code", "description": "Python code for payment calculations only. Write clean, readable Python across multiple lines as needed. Use proper line breaks between statements - do NOT use semicolons to chain statements. NO COMMENTS allowed. Example:\nfrom decimal import Decimal\ndebt = Decimal('1250.00')\ndown = Decimal('250.00')\ninstallments = 4\nmonthly = ((debt - down) / installments).quantize(Decimal('0.01'))\nprint(monthly)", "type": "string", "required": true, "items": null}], "filler_text": "I am just verifying something. "}, "tool_filler_type": "<class 'str'>"} [90m{"call_id": "call_simulation_5fd074c", "room_name": null, "tenant_id": null} [90m/Users/vansh/Developer/agent-orchestrator/agent_orchestrator/proagent/state_loop.py:397[0m

