 "required": true, "items": null}, {"name": "discount_amount", "description": "The discount amount for the payment arrangement. Defaults to 0", "type": "number", "required": true, "items": null}, {"name": "payment_plan_type", "description": "The type of payment arrangement. Must be 'settlement' or 'installment'. Use 'settlement' only for settlement offers. Use 'installment' for all other arrangement types including reinstatement, Optima, and regular payment plans.", "type": "string", "required": true, "items": null}, {"name": "schedule", "description": "Complete list of every payment in the arrangement, in chronological order. Must include ALL payments discussed on the call \u2014 including any down payment as the first entry. Each entry must reflect the exact amount and date agreed upon with the consumer. Do not flatten variable amounts into equal installments. VALIDATION: The sum of all amounts in this array must equal the total amount the consumer agreed to pay. For settlements, this is the discounted settlement amount. For non-settlement plans, this is the full debt amount. If a down payment was agreed, the number of recurring installments = (total_to_pay - down_payment) / installment_amount \u2014 do not use the total plan duration as the recurring count.", "type": "array", "required": true, "items": {"type": "object", "properties": {"amount": {"description": "The payment amount", "type": "number"}, "currency": {"description": "The currency of the payment", "type": "string"}, "scheduled_at": {"description": "The scheduled date for the payment", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["amount", "currency", "scheduled_at"], "additionalProperties": false}}], "filler_text": "Please hold while I process this."}, "tool_filler_type": "<class 'str'>"} [90m{"call_id": "call_simulation_5fd074c", "room_name": null, "tenant_id": null} [90m/Users/vansh/Developer/agent-orchestrator/agent_orchestrator/proagent/state_loop.py:397[0m
